menu "HTTP management server"
    config HTTP_SERVER_CLAW_ENABLE
        bool "Enable Claw web features"
        default y
        help
            Enable Claw settings, chat, memory, capabilities, skills and Lua
            web routes. Disabling this affects only the web management UI;
            the firmware's Claw runtime continues to operate. System status,
            network/time settings, Matter management and files remain available.
endmenu
